  "solution": "**BODMAS Rule:**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/42dd607f5aa96af84ef6843d85c88e5db7b3a046acecfcb7d5037faa1c65b957.png] \n\nGiven equation: 20 ÷ 5 × 3 + 10 − 4 = 20\n\n1. 20 and 10\n\nGiven equation: 20 ÷ 5 × 3 + 10 − 4 = 20\n\nSwapping the numbers in the equation, we get:\n\n⇒ __**10 ÷ **____**5**__ × 3 + 20 − 4 = 20 \n\n⇒ __**2**____** × **____**3**__ + 20 − 4 = 20 \n\n⇒ __**6**____** + 2**____**0**__ − 4 = 20 \n\n⇒ __**26**____** − **____**4**__ = 20 \n\n⇒ 22 ≠ 20 \n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n2. 3 and 4\n\nGiven equation: 20 ÷ 5 × 3 + 10 − 4 = 20\n\nSwapping the numbers in the equation, we get:\n\n⇒ __**20 ÷ **____**5**__ × 4 + 10 − 3 = 20\n\n⇒ __**4**____** × 4**__ + 10 − 3 = 20\n\n⇒ __**16**____** + **____**10**__ − 3 = 20\n\n⇒ __**26**____** − 3**__ = 20\n\n⇒ 23 ≠ 20\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n3. 4 and 5\n\nGiven equation: 20 ÷ 5 × 3 + 10 − 4 = 20\n\nSwapping the numbers in the equation, we get:\n\n⇒ __**20 ÷ 4**__ × 3 + 10 − 5 = 20\n\n⇒ __**5**____** × **____**3**__ + 10 − 5 = 20\n\n⇒ __**15**____** + **____**10**__ − 5 = 20\n\n⇒ __**25**____** − 5**__ = 20\n\n⇒ 20 = 20\n\n⇒ LHS = RHS\n\n4. 5 and 10\n\nGiven equation: 20 ÷ 5 × 3 + 10 − 4 = 20\n\nSwapping the numbers in the equation, we get:\n\n⇒ __**20 ÷ 10**__ × 3 + 5 − 4 = 20\n\n⇒ __**2 × **____**3**__ + 5 − 4 = 20\n\n⇒ __**6**____** + 5**__ − 4 = 20\n\n⇒ __**11**____** − **____**4**__ = 20\n\n⇒ 7 ≠ 20\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"**Option 3**\".",
